From 61368b663263cb1807e2a34f9ac282f9705d75c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LR Recomp <noreply@lr-recomp.invalid>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 07:44:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 045/108] gpu: vulkan: optional one-frame GPU command trace
 (vulkan_gpu_trace_frame)

With vulkan_gpu_timing, logs the command sequence of one frame every 10 s:
render pass begins with their signature, draw counts and end reasons,
resolves (source, size, destination format and address, clears), texture
loads (size, format, address) and shared memory uploads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

